      "id": "b1774624269511kidr",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "This project started as an experiment in looping animation — what happens when a scene has no clear beginning or end.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b17746242695112x9e",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "Developed over three months, working entirely in-house from concept to final render.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b17746242695110tcd",
      "type": "quote",
      "content": "The loop isn't a gimmick. It's the point.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b17746242695115rei",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
