      "content": "<b>Process</b>",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1774624269511osft",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "Blocked out the timing in After Effects first, then moved into Cinema 4D for the 3D work. The character rig was built from scratch.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "b17746242695117xe3",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "<i>Compositing</i> done in After Effects with some light <b>colour grading</b> in DaVinci.",
      "align": "left"
    },
